Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "GorillaAndWildlifeObstacleScene" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :gorilla1 ;
    :hasObstacle :overturnedVehicle ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:gorilla1 a :Actor ;
    :description "Gorilla moving across the road" .

:overturnedVehicle a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Overturned red vehicle on the road" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Sunny day condition" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with wild animals and road debris" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision with wild animals and road debris
Severity Score: 0.95